A ((loglang)) unrelated to ((Loglan)) in which hex is the default base. ((Tinkit)) has used its existence to argue that Lojban is hex by default, which seems like broken logic to the rest of us.
*zo'ocai mi'e ((tinkit)) .i ji'a ko tcidu tu'a la'o gy. [http://www.geocities.com/Athens/Agora/7070/liva.htm] .gy.
